# VigilAIAgent — Advanced Roadmap (Living Plan)

**Goal:** Make VigilAIAgent surpass Cursor for **large / heavy local projects** — deep understanding, strong agent autonomy, solid IDE language power, and reliable ops — while staying **local-first** (Tauri 2 + React + Vite + sidecar).

**How to use this file (mandatory workflow):**
1. Pick the next unchecked item under **Next up** or the highest-priority open wave.
2. Implement the slice; keep VigilHub (`…/VigilHub/VigilHub`) as **reference only**.
3. Run tests (`npm test`) and a focused typecheck when UI/TS changed (`npx tsc --noEmit`).
4. Only after green: mark the item `✅`, move notes to **Done**, and refresh **Next up**.
5. If mid-work you discover a gap, bug, or new advanced need → **add it here immediately** (under the right wave or **Discovered during work**). Do not rely on chat memory alone.
6. Do **not** commit unless the user asks.

**Status legend:** `✅` done · `🟨` partial / needs polish · `[ ]` not started

